  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>Force Pikes are 1-meter-long poles topped with power tips. A two-setting power dial located near the bottom of the pike allows the user to set the weapon to \"Lethal\" or \"<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stun\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stun\">Stun</a>\". Although primarily a Vibro weapon, the Force Pike also delivers an electrical shock through its tip, dealing both piercing and energy damage. </p><p>A Force Pike requires two <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cells</a> to operate. </p>",
